0..71 Comment "// An omitted model implicit resolved: a call that leaves out the model"
72..151 Comment "// a function quantifies over passes the one module in scope that is a model of"
152..228 Comment "// its theory at the types its explicit arguments force. No module is marked"
229..307 Comment "// as an instance: every module whose ascription is `Model(Count)`, or a model"
308..384 Comment "// of a theory including `Count`, is a candidate. `model-resolution-swapped`"
385..457 Comment "// imports the same two modules the other way round, and resolves alike."
458..460 Comment "//"
461..475 Comment "// - see: #739"
